  (text "Section 4 of the circuit notes, stage 8. A two-stage high-frequency roll-off is reported for the series [3], and the pedal's\nspeaker sim is documented as smooth, without peaks or notches [1]; its circuit is not public. UX8, UX9: two unity-gain Sallen-Key\nlow-passes, -3 dB together at about 3.7 kHz with no peak; UX10: a 30 Hz high-pass for the cabinet's low end (all chosen).\nSWX1: Cab Bypass (not on the pedal). In the DSP it crossfades between the voiced and the unfiltered signal; drawn as a switch." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 198.12 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "14971913-fc27-556a-b318-3cd89f453ce6"))
